                      00260         
                      00261         *Output registers
                      00262         *This routine outputs the current contents
                      00263         *of the machine registers. The PC value is the
                      00264         *return address left by the call to this routine.
                      00265         
F923 347F             00266         PRTREG  PSHS   #$7F              push all but PC
F925 1F43             00267                 TFR    S,U               copy stack pointer
F927 8D04             00268                 BSR    PRTR1             call output routine
F929 35FF             00269                 PULS   #$FF              exit by pulling all regs
                      00270         
                      00271         *Callable subroutine for use by debugger - outputs
